<p>Keyword research only matters if it ends in a plan you can act on. We skip the generic keyword-tool export and start from what your real competitors already rank for, the clearest signal of what works in your market.</p>

<h2>What is included</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Competitor gap analysis against three to five direct competitors</li>
  <li>Search intent mapping: informational, commercial or transactional</li>
  <li>Keyword difficulty weighed against realistic opportunity, not just volume</li>
  <li>Country-level data and wording for the UK, Ireland, Europe or Australia</li>
  <li>A content plan mapping each keyword to an existing or new page</li>
</ul>

<p>This is usually the starting point before on-page work or new content. It tells you exactly what to write about, and why.</p>
